Revision history for EEL

{{$NEXT}}
    - Initial release of EEL, an event pattern language for Raku Supplies.
    - Add event and pattern declarations with captures, recursion, proto/multi
      dispatch, alternatives, repetition and interleaving.
    - Support partitioning, event-time windows, lookahead and absence detection.
    - Provide Supply.match with object matching and optional event reemission.
    - Add an indexed in-memory runner for active patterns and temporal queries.
    - Provide the eel CLI for JSONL logs, transformations, inline event definitions
      and timestamp-ordered merging of files and live streams.
